💡 Learning

I learned that the model does not simply copy the driving video.

Instead:

Driving Video
     ↓
Motion Information
     ↓
Keypoint Detection
     ↓
Motion Transfer
     ↓
Generator
     ↓
Animated Frames

The appearance comes from the source image, while motion information is extracted from the driving sequence.

